F64
Bool
Device

charge:
  ?device shape Device
  ?charge shape F64
  ?device:
    charge: ?charge

mode charge given device yields charge: one
accepted:
  ?device shape Device
  ?accepted shape Bool
  ?device:
    accepted: ?accepted

mode accepted given device yields accepted: one
attempts:
  ?device shape Device
  ?attempts shape F64
  ?device:
    attempts: ?attempts

mode attempts given device yields attempts: one

device
  member of: Device
device charge 1.0
device accepted false
device attempts 0.0

bind keyboard Use down to use

on use ?device
  when
    ?device charge ?charge
    ?charge > 0.0
  withdraw
    ?device charge ?charge
  include
    ?device charge ?charge - 1.0

on use ?device
  when
    ?device charge ?charge
    ?device accepted ?accepted
    ?device attempts ?attempts
  withdraw
    ?device accepted ?accepted
    ?device attempts ?attempts
  include
    ?device accepted (?charge > 0.0)
    ?device attempts ?attempts + 1.0
